{"type": "CSW_CAMPAIGN", "campaignTitle": {"de": "Gamescom", "en": "Gamescom"}, "levels": [{"headline": {"de": "Ab zur gr\u00f6\u00dften Computerspielemesse!", "en": "Off to the world's biggest gaming show!", "fr": "Cap sur le plus grand salon de jeux vid\u00e9o !", "es": "\u00a1Rumbo a la mayor feria de videojuegos del mundo!", "pt": "Rumo \u00e0 maior feira de videojogos do mundo!"}, "sublines": [{"de": "2 Personen \u00b7 Dom-Vorplatz \u00b7 Rhein-\u00dcberquerung", "en": "2 persons \u00b7 Cathedral square \u00b7 Rhine crossing", "fr": "2 personnes \u00b7 Parvis \u00b7 Travers\u00e9e du Rhin", "es": "2 personas \u00b7 Plaza de la catedral \u00b7 Cruce del Rin", "pt": "2 pessoas \u00b7 Adro da catedral \u00b7 Travessia do Reno"}], "briefing": {"de": "Auf der Gamescom kam es zu einem Zwischenfall. Zwei verletzte Personen wurden auf dem Domplatz gemeldet. Transportieren Sie die Verletzten \u00fcber den Rhein zur Koelnmesse. Der Landebereich ist markiert. Flotten Sie, Pilot.", "en": "An incident occurred at Gamescom. Two injured persons have been reported on the Cathedral square. Transport the injured across the Rhine to the Koelnmesse. The landing zone is marked. Move fast, pilot.", "fr": "Un incident s'est produit \u00e0 la Gamescom. Deux bless\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 signal\u00e9s sur le parvis de la cath\u00e9drale. Transportez les bless\u00e9s au-del\u00e0 du Rhin jusqu'\u00e0 la Koelnmesse. La zone d'atterrissage est balis\u00e9e. Vite, pilote.", "es": "Se ha producido un incidente en la Gamescom. Dos personas heridas han sido reportadas en la plaza de la catedral. Transporte a los heridos cruzando el Rin hasta la Koelnmesse. La zona de aterrizaje est\u00e1 marcada. R\u00e1pido, piloto.", "pt": "Ocorreu um incidente na Gamescom. Duas pessoas feridas foram reportadas na pra\u00e7a da catedral. Transporte os feridos pelo Reno at\u00e9 \u00e0 Koelnmesse. A zona de aterragem est\u00e1 marcada. Depressa, piloto."}, "gridSize": 70, "terrain": "3x39,10,21,36,48,56,58,